<view class="page"><view class="masthead"><text class="eyebrow">TRAVEL LEDGER</text><text class="title">我的旅行</text><text class="subtitle">每一笔消费，都有清楚的去向。</text></view><view class="card"><text class="label">旅行名称</text><input placeholder="例如：东京周末" value="{{name}}" bindinput="onName"/><view class="currency"><text>结算币种</text><picker range="{{currencies}}" bindchange="onCurrency"><text>{{currency}}</text></picker></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="createTrip">创建并录入消费</button></view>